		p. Version Control and Change Management
			§ Manage the different versions during the development.
			§ If something goes wrong, can go back to previous stable branch.
			§ Can track all the changes and rebuild all the data.
			§ Change management
				§ A formal process of managing change
				§ Avoid downtime, confusion and mistakes.
				§ Nothing changes without the process
				§ Have recovery plan if change doesn't work
				§ Test before making the change make sure doesn't introduce new vulnerabilities.
				§ Document all the approvals
				
		q. Provisioning and Deprovisioning
			i. Provisioning
				§ Deploying or making everything available to deploy an application.
				§ For application -web server, db server, middleware server, user workstation configurations, certificate updates etc.
				§ App s/w secuirty - OS, applications
				§ n/w security - VLAN, internal access
				§ Orchestration
					® Automate provisioning i.e. availability of the app and other components required by it.
			ii. Deprovisioning
				§ Process of removing app and apps associated with it
				§ Remove all the data, access associated with it
				
