				§ Bad guy posts message to s a social network(including payload). It's now persistent. Anyone who comes across this gets the payload(anyone who reads, shares).
			§ Don't clicking unknown links, disable javascripts, update web browser, user input validation helps mitigate attack.
			
		e. Cross-site Request Forgery (XSRF or CSRF or One-click attack or Session Riding)
			§ Takes advantage of trust that a web app has for user
